'''Croesus''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Dungeon Hub}}. They will store a player's [[Dungeon Reward Chest]] and [[Kuudra/Loot|Kuudra Reward Chest]] from any [[Dungeons|Floor]]. Croesus can keep up to {{Green|60}} runs, and each run has a {{Green|72}} hours expiry date. The cost of the chests still apply.

