== Trivia ==
*'''Croesus''' is a reference to the king of Lydia of the [[w:Croesus|same name]]. He was renowned for his wealth, and his gifts were preserved after his death, similarly to '''Croesus'''.
*In their dialogue, '''Croesus''' makes a pun out of keeping a ''handle'' on things, referring to the {{Item|Necron's Handle}}.

